    "1.4.10.8": "Electro's PowerCraft 1.4.10.8\nMinecraft 1.20.1 | Release Notes\n\n----------------------------------------\nRELEASE CHANNEL: [ALPHA] [STARTER UPDATE]\nRELEASE DATE: July 2, 2026 (Minecraft 1.20.1 edition)\nORIGINAL VERSION DATE: August 5, 2024\n----------------------------------------\nThe Starter Update | Final 1.4.10.x release\n\nIMPORTANT COMPATIBILITY NOTICE\nThis release uses mod ID electros_mod. Versions 1.4.11+ use electros_powercraft; switching between these versions can remove existing mod blocks/items from a world. Back up your world before changing versions.\n\nCHANGELOG\n\n BUG FIXES\n- Fixed: ALS System - Sedate Applier\n- Fixed: HP Attribute Overrides\n- Fixed: ALS - Effects\n- Fixed: Recipe Unlocker\n\n SOUNDS/MUSIC\n- Added Song: Electro's PowerCraft Mod - Restful Vibes\n- Added Song: Davboy28 - Taco's Song (Remastered)\n- Added Song: Davboy28 - Spooky Graveyards\n- Added Sound: Shocked\n- Added Sound: Freezing\n\n ITEMS\n- Added item: Music Disc: Davboy's Friends - Taco's Song (Remastered)\n- Added item: Music Disc: Davboy28 - Smiling Critters (Rebooted)\n- Added item: Music Disc: Davboy28- Ethereal Expanse\n- Added item: Music Disc: Davboy's Friends - Davboy's Song (Electro's Cover)\n\n POTIONS\n- Added Potion of Chilliness\n\n GAMERULES\n- Added Spawn Champions\n\n STRUCTURES\n- Added Medical Workhouse\n\n LANGUAGES\n- Added Filipino\n- Added German\n- Added French\n- Modified Spanish (Spain)\n- Modified Spanish (Mexico)\n- Modified Japanese\n\n MODIFIED\n- Modified HP of Entities\n- Modified Overlay - Bleeding\n- Modified Electric Powered Soldier Attacks\n- Modified ALS Counter\n- Modified Ice Bow\n- Modified Medical Cabinet Hardness\n- Modified Electro's Melee Book\n\n OTHERS\n- Added Ice Bow Animation\n- Added Sound Subtitles\n- Added Mob Attributes Scale\n- Added Champions",
    "1.4.10": "Electro's PowerCraft 1.4.10\nMinecraft 1.20.1 | Release Notes\n\n----------------------------------------\nRELEASE CHANNEL: [ALPHA] [STARTER UPDATE]\nRELEASE DATE: June 7, 2024\n----------------------------------------\nThe Starter Update | Initial public release\n\nCOMPATIBILITY NOTE\nThis release uses the original mod ID electros_mod. Version 1.4.11 and later changed it to electros_powercraft; back up existing worlds before switching versions.\n\nCHANGELOG\n\nHIGHLIGHTS\n- The public Starter Update introduced powered elemental equipment, additional infected/zombified mobs, medical content, and new systems.\n\nNEW ENTITIES AND COMBAT\n- Added Powered Electric Soldier, Zombified Powered Electric Soldier, Wendigo Stage 1, Zombified Ice Soldier, Zombified Sheep, and Zombified Pig.\n- Added Powered Projectile, Powered Sword I, and electrical-powered procedures.\n- Fixed Sun Burn and Decay attacks; updated the Sedate and Fury effects.\n- Added Slight Electricity damage source, Abrasion and Deep Laceration effects, and an ALS system/command.\n\nITEMS, FOOD, BLOCKS, AND STRUCTURES\n- Added Noodles Flavored Soup, Empty Bowl, Medical Cabinet, and Medical Villager profession.\n- Added the Medical Workhouse structure.\n- Added the Punch sound and Smiling Critters Remastered and Meditative Gardens music.\n- Updated Radiated Flesh after-eating status effects.\n\nWORLD, GAMEPLAY, AND PROGRESSION\n- Adjusted Elemental Block generation and Elemental Villager trades.\n- Added the Survival Starter Pack gamerule and player-respawn effect procedure.\n- Updated the Electro's Guide Book and stack sizes for the Guide and Melee Training books.\n- Updated icons for Sedate, Fury, Fuse, Stunned, Auto-Heal, Bleeding, Freezing, and Shocked effects.\n- Updated Spanish and Japanese translations and added Spanish (Mexico).",
