    "1.4.4": "Electro's PowerCraft 1.4.4\nMinecraft 1.20.1 | Release Notes\n\n----------------------------------------\nRELEASE CHANNEL: [RELEASE] [PRE-RELEASE] [ARCHIVED]\nRELEASE DATE: May 18, 2024 (Electro's Web Center)\nCURSEFORGE: June 7, 2024 (now archived)\n----------------------------------------\nPre-release | Recipes and Decay Balance\n\nCHANGELOG\n\nTEXTURES, GAMEPLAY, AND RECIPES\n- Added a Cotton Flower inventory texture.\n- Updated Decay attacks for Easy, Normal, and Hard difficulty, including their timers.\n- Modified crafting recipes for Electric Swords I-III, Ice Sword I, and Antibiotics.",
    "1.4.3": "Electro's PowerCraft 1.4.3\nMinecraft 1.20.1 | Release Notes\n\n----------------------------------------\nRELEASE CHANNEL: [RELEASE] [PRE-RELEASE] [ARCHIVED]\nRELEASE DATE: May 17, 2024 (Electro's Web Center)\nCURSEFORGE: June 7, 2024 (now archived)\n----------------------------------------\nPre-release | Music Disc Update\n\nCHANGELOG\n\nMUSIC\n- Added Davboy's Friends - Taco's Song (Electro's Cover).\n- Added its corresponding music disc.",
    "1.4.2": "Electro's PowerCraft 1.4.2\nMinecraft 1.20.1 | Release Notes\n\n----------------------------------------\nRELEASE CHANNEL: [RELEASE] [PRE-RELEASE] [ARCHIVED]\nRELEASE DATE: May 17, 2024 (Electro's Web Center)\nCURSEFORGE: June 7, 2024 (now archived)\n----------------------------------------\nPre-release | Melee AI Update\n\nCHANGELOG\n\nENTITY AI\n- Updated melee AI tasks for Electric Soldier Levels 1 and 2 and the Electric Soldier Trainer.\n- Updated melee AI tasks for Ice Soldier Levels 1 and 2 and the Ice Soldier Trainer.\n- Updated melee AI tasks for Ice Ranged Soldier Levels 1 and 2, Ice, and Electro Levels 1, 5, and 10.",
    "1.4.1": "Electro's PowerCraft 1.4.1\nMinecraft 1.20.1 | Release Notes\n\n----------------------------------------\nRELEASE CHANNEL: [RELEASE] [PRE-RELEASE] [ARCHIVED]\nRELEASE DATE: May 17, 2024 (Electro's Web Center)\nCURSEFORGE: June 7, 2024 (now archived)\n----------------------------------------\nPre-release | Music Disc Update\n\nCHANGELOG\n\nMUSIC\n- Added Davboy's Friends - Electro's Song (Electro's Cover).\n- Added its corresponding music disc.",
    "1.4": "Electro's PowerCraft 1.4\nMinecraft 1.20.1 | Release Notes\n\n----------------------------------------\nRELEASE CHANNEL: [RELEASE] [PRE-RELEASE] [ARCHIVED]\nRELEASE DATE: May 17, 2024 (Electro's Web Center)\nCURSEFORGE: June 7, 2024 (now archived)\n----------------------------------------\nPre-release | Reserved Version\n\nCHANGELOG\n\nRELEASE INFORMATION\n- Reserved pre-release mod version. No additional feature details are documented in the original Java Update Checker.",
    "1.3": "Electro's PowerCraft 1.3\nMinecraft 1.20.1 | Release Notes\n\n----------------------------------------\nRELEASE CHANNEL: [BETA] [PRE-RELEASE] [ARCHIVED]\nRELEASE DATE: May 17, 2024 (Electro's Web Center)\nCURSEFORGE: June 7, 2024 (now archived)\n----------------------------------------\nEarly Release | Fourth Mod Version\n\nCHANGELOG\n\nNEW ENTITIES\n- Added Ice Ranged Soldier and Trainer Soldier variants.\n- Added Herobrine, Powerful Creepers, and Infected Villagers.\n- Added Electro Level 10, Electric Soldier Level 2, and Ice Soldier Level 2.\n- Added JacksonZombiez and Radiated Zombie.\n\nRELEASE INFORMATION\n- Fourth development version, distributed as an early release.",
    "1.2": "Electro's PowerCraft 1.2\nMinecraft 1.20.1 | Release Notes\n\n----------------------------------------\nRELEASE CHANNEL: [DEVELOPMENT] [INTERNAL BUILD]\nCREATED: November 30, 2023\nRELEASE DATE: Not publicly released\n----------------------------------------\nEarly Development | Third Mod Version\n\nCHANGELOG\n\nWORLD AND VILLAGERS\n- Added the Elemental Block.\n- Added the Elemental Villager profession.\n\nRELEASE INFORMATION\n- Third development version.",
    "1.1": "Electro's PowerCraft 1.1\nMinecraft 1.20.1 | Release Notes\n\n----------------------------------------\nRELEASE CHANNEL: [DEVELOPMENT] [INTERNAL BUILD]\nCREATED: November 30, 2023\nRELEASE DATE: Not publicly released\n----------------------------------------\nEarly Development | Second Mod Version\n\nCHANGELOG\n\nNEW ENTITIES\n- Added Ice Level 1 and Ice Soldier Level 1.\n\nNEW ITEMS\n- Added Ice Source, Ice Power, and Ice Sword I.\n\nRELEASE INFORMATION\n- Second development version.",
    "1.0": "Electro's PowerCraft 1.0\nMinecraft 1.20.1 | Release Notes\n\n----------------------------------------\nRELEASE CHANNEL: [DEVELOPMENT] [INTERNAL BUILD]\nCREATED: November 29, 2023\nRELEASE DATE: Not publicly released\n----------------------------------------\nEarly Development | First Mod Version\n\nCHANGELOG\n\nNEW ENTITIES\n- Added Electro Levels 1 and 5 and Electric Soldier Level 1.\n\nNEW ITEMS\n- Added Electric Source, Electric Power, Energetic Electric Power, Electric Sword I, and Electric Sword II.\n\nRELEASE INFORMATION\n- First mod version; the beginning of Electro's PowerCraft."
